OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors down 20% at nature
OL,4,Areserve after wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bird reserve, where a devastating
OL,7,Fwildfire started, said visitor numbers
OL,8,Fhave fallen by 20% since it reopened.
OL,10,FThe fire, which started on 29 July,
OL,11,Fcaused huge damage to Dunwich Heath but
OL,12,Fis believed to have started at
OL,13,Fneighbouring RSPB Minsmere.
OL,15,FMinsmere reopened over a week later and
OL,16,Ffigures from the RSPB show over a
OL,17,Fthousand fewer visitors came to the
OL,18,Fsite between 11-31 August than during
OL,19,Fthe same period the year before.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
