OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors down 20% at nature
OL,4,Areserve after wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FRSPB area manager Adam Rowlands said:
OL,7,F"We want to let visitors know that we
OL,8,Fhave now fully reopened. It is safe to
OL,9,Freturn and to come and experience the
OL,10,Fwonderful wildlife that the reserve has
OL,11,Fto offer as we value their continued
OL,12,Fsupport."
